# ---- Database ----
# Local dev: run `docker compose up -d` then use this value as-is.
# Production: point at your provisioned Postgres (Neon / Supabase / RDS / etc.) — a decision
# still open, see "القرارات وبيانات الاعتماد المطلوبة منك" in the project plan doc.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://pharmacy:pharmacy@localhost:5432/pharmacy_ai?schema=public"

# ---- Auth ----
# Generate with: openssl rand -base64 48
JWT_SECRET="replace-me-with-a-long-random-secret"
JWT_EXPIRES_IN="12h"

# ---- Seed (Phase 1 bootstrap SUPER ADMIN) ----
SEED_SUPERADMIN_EMAIL="admin@example.com"
SEED_SUPERADMIN_PASSWORD="change-me-immediately"

# ---- WhatsApp Business Cloud API (Phase 4) ----
# For local testing you do NOT need your own business-verified number yet: every Meta app
# gets a free TEST number (Meta for Developers → your app → WhatsApp → API Setup) with a
# temporary access token and up to 5 verified recipient numbers, good for the whole flow
# below. Swap in your real business number later — no code change, just these values.
# WHATSAPP_ACCESS_TOKEN=            # "Temporary access token" (test) or a permanent System User token (production)
# WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=         # from the same API Setup page
# WHATSAPP_APP_SECRET=              # App Dashboard → Settings → Basic → App Secret (verifies X-Hub-Signature-256)
# WHATSAPP_WEBHOOK_VERIFY_TOKEN=    # a string YOU make up and enter in both places when configuring the webhook
# WHATSAPP_API_VERSION=v21.0        # Graph API version; bump as Meta deprecates old ones
#
# ---- ربط واتساب المباشر مع Meta (الأساسي الآن) ----
# WHATSAPP_PROVIDER=meta            # meta (الافتراضي) أو kapso — kapso يبقي الربط القديم عبر Kapso
# WHATSAPP_TOKEN=                   # التوكن (الاسم الأقدم WHATSAPP_ACCESS_TOKEN ما زال مقبولاً)
# WHATSAPP_VERIFY_TOKEN=            # النص الذي تكتبه أنت في Meta عند حفظ الـ Webhook (الاسم الأقدم WHATSAPP_WEBHOOK_VERIFY_TOKEN ما زال مقبولاً)
# WHATSAPP_APP_SECRET=              # للتحقق من توقيع X-Hub-Signature-256
# WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=         # معرّف الرقم في Meta
# عنوان الـ Webhook في Meta: https://<موقعك>/api/webhook/whatsapp

# ---- WhatsApp via Kapso (بديل عن ميتا المباشر — لا يحتاج رقماً مسجّلاً عند ميتا) ----
# Kapso is an official Meta Business Partner; it exposes the SAME Cloud API through a proxy, so
# when KAPSO_API_KEY is set, src/lib/whatsapp.ts sends through Kapso instead of graph.facebook.com
# (WHATSAPP_ACCESS_TOKEN / WHATSAPP_APP_SECRET are then not needed). WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID is the
# phone number id shown in Kapso for the number you connected (sandbox or your own US number).
# KAPSO_API_KEY=
# KAPSO_WEBHOOK_SECRET=       # من لوحة Kapso: WhatsApp → Webhooks → السر الخاص بالـ webhook
# KAPSO_ACT_AS_CARELINK=true  # يجعل رقم Kapso يقوم بدور رقم كير لينك مؤقتاً (يتطلب أيضاً WHATSAPP_CARELINK_PHONE_NUMBER_ID = نفس WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID)
# KAPSO_DISPLAY_PHONE_NUMBER= # اختياري: الرقم الذي يراسله الزبائن، بالأرقام فقط (لربط المحادثة بصيدلية/كير لينك)

# ---- Anthropic API (Phase 5) ----
# Get this from the Anthropic Console (platform.claude.com) → API Keys → Create Key — it
# starts with "sk-ant-..." (the exact prefix after "sk-ant-" has changed over time; don't
# assume one specific prefix is the only valid shape — if in doubt, create it fresh there and
# use whatever it shows you). The request/response shape this project sends was manually
# verified against the real API with a real key this session — see src/lib/anthropic.ts's top
# comment. What's still NOT verified in this sandbox is the full Tool-Calling loop
# (src/lib/aiOrchestrator.ts) against a real database — that needs `prisma generate` to work,
# which this sandbox's network policy blocks (see README's "Known limitation"). Fill this in
# and the WhatsApp webhook (src/app/api/whatsapp/webhook/route.ts) will start calling it
# automatically for any conversation with assignedAgent=AI — no other code change needed.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5   # optional override; re-check GET /v1/models if this ever 404s — model ids get retired

# ---- File storage (Phase 8, Document AI) ----
# DECIDED this session: Cloudflare R2 (see src/lib/storage.ts's top comment for why, and
# DEPLOY.md for how to create the bucket + these four values). Fill them in and Phase 8's
# routes — currently a clean 501 — start actually moving bytes. No other code change needed.
FILE_STORAGE_PROVIDER=r2
# R2_BUCKET=
# R2_ACCOUNT_ID=
# R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
# R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=

# ---- CareLink (Phase 7) — NOW ACTUALLY BUILT, not just prep. Confirmed this session: CareLink
# is a real order-broker — customers message its OWN WhatsApp number, our AI searches
# inventory, asks the fulfilling branch (over WhatsApp) to reserve + quote a price, relays that
# to the customer, and on approval creates the order and notifies CareLink's own delivery line —
# all WhatsApp/text, confirmed NOT a voice call. See prisma/schema.prisma's CarelinkInquiry
# model and src/lib/carelink.ts for the real implementation.
#
# This is the actual phone number CareLink customers message/call — unchanged from before:
CARELINK_CONTACT_WHATSAPP="+96179003663"
#
# This is DIFFERENT: it's the Meta-internal "Phone Number ID" (not the phone number itself —
# see WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID's own comment above for the same distinction on the default
# number) for the SAME CareLink number above, needed so our AI's replies to CareLink customers
# go out FROM CareLink's identity rather than the pharmacy's default number. Register
# +96179003663 as an additional number under the same Meta WhatsApp Business App (Meta for
# Developers → your app → WhatsApp → API Setup → Add phone number) and paste its Phone Number
# ID here. Until this is set, src/lib/conversations.ts's sendReply() refuses to send a reply in
# a CARELINK-channel conversation (loudly, not silently falling back to the wrong number).
# WHATSAPP_CARELINK_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=
#
# DELIVERY ROUTING (decided): the "notify delivery" step goes to the delivery contact of the order's
# PHARMACY (Branch.specialDeliveryContactWhatsapp: Beirut -> شركة المختار, الجواد كير and العاصي -> their
# own delivery person), never to the CareLink number above. Optional last-resort general delivery line
# for a pharmacy that has none (must NOT be the CareLink customer number):
# CARELINK_DELIVERY_CONTACT_WHATSAPP=
#
# TEMPLATES (WhatsApp 24-hour rule): a pharmacy or delivery person who has not messaged the CareLink
# number in the last 24h can only receive an approved template. Names (override only if you named them
# differently in WhatsApp Manager) and language:
# WHATSAPP_TPL_RESERVATION=carelink_reservation_request   # 3 variables
# WHATSAPP_TPL_DELIVERY=carelink_delivery_request         # 4 variables
# WHATSAPP_TEMPLATE_LANG=ar_LB   # must match the template language shown in WhatsApp Manager (Arabic (LBN) = ar_LB)
# WHATSAPP_WABA_ID=1111794758260981   # only used by /api/carelink/readiness to read template status
#
# Kept only in case CareLink turns out to also expose a real API platform some day (no evidence
# of one — everything confirmed this session is WhatsApp-based):
# CARELINK_BASE_URL=
# CARELINK_USERNAME=
# CARELINK_PASSWORD=
